{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20848","headline":"河南府试十二月乐词 九月 · 李贺","name":"河南府试十二月乐词 九月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"离宫散萤天似水，竹黄池冷芙蓉死。\n月缀金铺光脉脉，凉苑虚庭空澹白。\n露花飞飞风草草，翠锦斓斑满层道。\n鸡人罢唱晓珑璁𤧚，鸦啼金井下疎桐","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20848.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20848","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}